<body><div class="noise"></div><header class="nav" id="nav"><div class="wrap nav-in"><a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="mark display">A</span><span><strong class="display">AWE PRINT</strong><small class="mono">DTF PRINTING STUDIO</small></span></a><nav class="links"><a href="#layanan">Layanan</a><a href="#alur">Alur kerja</a><a href="#cabang">Cabang</a></nav><a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ auth()->check() ? (auth()->user()->hasRole('Customer') ? route('customer.dashboard') : route('dashboard')) : route('login') }}">{{ auth()->check() ? 'Buka Dashboard' : 'Masuk Dashboard' }} <span>↗</span></a></div></header>
<main id="top"><section class="hero"><div class="orb one"></div><div class="orb two"></div><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div data-reveal><div class="eyebrow mono"><i class="pulse"></i> Production system online</div><h1 class="display">Print bold.<br><span>Move faster.</span></h1><p class="lead">Cetak DTF premium dengan proses yang transparan—mulai dari file, approval desain, pembayaran, produksi, hingga pesanan siap diterima.</p><div class="actions"><a href="{{ route('register') }}" class="btn btn-primary">Mulai Pesanan <span>→</span></a><a href="#alur" class="btn btn-ghost">Lihat cara kerja</a></div><div class="trust mono"><span>PRECISION PRINTING</span><i class="trust-line"></i><span>EPUL × RAPLY</span></div></div><div class="machine" data-reveal><div class="machine-frame" id="machine"><div class="machine-top mono"><span>AWE / DTF-9000</span><span class="lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><div class="film"><div class="rail"><div class="head"></div></div><div class="film-art"><div class="film-logo display">AW</div></div></div><div class="machine-bottom"><div class="progress-label mono"><span>PRINTING JOB #0482</span><span>74%</span></div><div class="progress"><span></span></div><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><small>STATUS</small><b>PRINTING</b></div><div class="metric"><small>QUALITY</small><b>ULTRA</b></div><div class="metric"><small>QUEUE</small><b>08 JOB</b></div></div></div></div><div class="float-ticket ticket-a"><b class="display">Color calibrated</b><small class="mono">CMYK / 300 DPI</small></div><div class="float-ticket ticket-b"><b class="display">Quality checked</b><small class="mono">READY TO PRESS</small></div></div></div></section>
<div class="marquee"><div class="marquee-track"><span>DESIGN REVIEW</span><span>DTF PRINTING</span><span>QUALITY CONTROL</span><span>REAL-TIME STATUS</span><span>DESIGN REVIEW</span><span>DTF PRINTING</span><span>QUALITY CONTROL</span><span>REAL-TIME STATUS</span></div></div>
<section class="content" id="layanan"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head" data-reveal><div><span class="kicker mono">What we do</span><h2 class="display">Lebih dari sekadar mencetak.</h2></div><p>Workflow digital yang menjaga setiap pesanan tetap rapi, terukur, dan mudah dipantau dari satu dashboard.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="card" style="--accent:var(--lime)" data-reveal><div class="card-no mono"><span>01 / PRINT</span><span class="icon">P</span></div><h3 class="display">DTF Custom Premium</h3><p>Warna tajam, detail presisi, dan hasil konsisten untuk brand clothing, komunitas, maupun kebutuhan personal.</p></article><article class="card" style="--accent:var(--cyan)" data-reveal><div class="card-no mono"><span>02 / DESIGN</span><span class="icon">D</span></div><h3 class="display">Design Assistance</h3><p>Kirim file siap cetak, minta dibuatkan desain, atau unggah file dengan catatan perubahan dari dashboard.</p></article><article class="card" style="--accent:var(--orange)" data-reveal><div class="card-no mono"><span>03 / TRACK</span><span class="icon">T</span></div><h3 class="display">Order Tracking</h3><p>Pantau pembayaran, approval preview, antrean produksi, quality control, hingga pesanan selesai.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="content" id="alur" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head" data-reveal><div><span class="kicker mono">Simple workflow</span><h2 class="display">Satu alur. Tanpa tebak-tebakan.</h2></div><p>Setiap checkpoint tercatat agar customer dan tim produksi selalu melihat status yang sama.</p></div><div class="flow" data-reveal>@foreach([['01','Upload brief','Pilih ukuran, qty, dan kirim desain atau brief.'],['02','Bayar aman','Gunakan gateway atau transfer sesuai cabang.'],['03','Approve desain','Periksa preview dan minta revisi bila perlu.'],['04','Track produksi','Pantau cetak, QC, hingga siap diterima.']] as [$no,$title,$desc])<article class="step"><span class="step-no mono">{{ $no }}</span><h3 class="display">{{ $title }}</h3><p>{{ $desc }}</p></article>@endforeach</div></div></section>
<section class="content" id="cabang"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head" data-reveal><div><span class="kicker mono">Two production points</span><h2 class="display">Dua cabang.<br>Satu standar.</h2></div><p>Pilih cabang tujuan saat membuat pesanan. Data dan proses produksi otomatis diarahkan ke tim yang tepat.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="card" style="--accent:var(--cyan)" data-reveal><div class="card-no mono"><span>BRANCH / 01</span><span>ACTIVE ●</span></div><h3 class="display">Awe Print Epul</h3><p>Production point dengan alur order, pembayaran, dan quality control yang terintegrasi.</p></article><article class="card" style="--accent:var(--lime)" data-reveal><div class="card-no mono"><span>BRANCH / 02</span><span>ACTIVE ●</span></div><h3 class="display">Awe Print Raply</h3><p>Kapasitas produksi terhubung dalam sistem yang sama, dengan akses data berbasis cabang.</p></article><article class="card" style="--accent:var(--orange)" data-reveal><div class="card-no mono"><span>SYSTEM / 24H</span><span>ONLINE ●</span></div><h3 class="display">Customer Dashboard</h3><p>Order dan status dapat diakses kapan saja, dari desktop maupun perangkat mobile.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="cta"><div class="wrap"><div class="cta-box" data-reveal><span class="kicker mono" style="color:#233117">Ready when you are</span><h2 class="display">Desainmu layak dicetak dengan serius.</h2><p>Buat akun, kirim brief, dan biarkan workflow kami menjaga proses berikutnya tetap transparan.</p><a href="{{ route('register') }}" class="btn">Buat Pesanan Sekarang <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section></main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footer-in"><div class="brand"><span class="mark display">A</span><span><strong class="display">AWE PRINT</strong><small class="mono">DTF PRINTING STUDIO</small></span></div><span class="mono">© {{ date('Y') }} · BUILT FOR BOLD IDEAS</span></div></footer>
<script>const nav=document.getElementById('nav');addEventListener('scroll',()=>nav.classList.toggle('scrolled',scrollY>24),{passive:true});const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>entries.forEach((entry,i)=>{if(entry.isIntersecting){setTimeout(()=>entry.target.classList.add('visible'),i*70);observer.unobserve(entry.target)}}),{threshold:.12});document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]').forEach(el=>observer.observe(el));document.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--mx',`${e.clientX}px`);document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--my',`${e.clientY}px`);const machine=document.getElementById('machine');if(machine&&innerWidth>900){const rx=(e.clientY/innerHeight-.5)*-5,ry=(e.clientX/innerWidth-.5)*8;machine.style.transform=`rotateX(${rx}deg) rotateY(${ry}deg)`}});</script>
